/// outside its source image.
///
/// ![](https://flutter.github.io/assets-for-api-docs/assets/dart-ui/tile_mode_clamp_linear.png)
/// ![](https://flutter.github.io/assets-for-api-docs/assets/dart-ui/tile_mode_clamp_radial.png)
/// ![](https://flutter.github.io/assets-for-api-docs/assets/dart-ui/tile_mode_clamp_sweep.png)␀Àtëƒ5Àxƒ/// Samples beyond the edge are repeated from the far end of the defined area.
///
/// For a gradient, this technique is as if the stop points from 0.0 to 1.0 were then
